meshpy                                tutorial
--------------------------------------------------------------------PROBLEM TYPE
PROBLEMTYPE                           Structure
RESTART                               0
------------------------------------------------------------------------------IO
OUTPUT_BIN                            yes
STRUCT_DISP                           yes
FILESTEPS                             1
VERBOSITY                             Standard
STRUCT_STRAIN                         yes
STRUCT_STRESS                         yes
--------------------------------------------------------------STRUCTURAL DYNAMIC
LINEAR_SOLVER                         1
INT_STRATEGY                          Standard
DYNAMICTYPE                           Statics
RESULTSEVERY                          1
NLNSOL                                fullnewton
TIMESTEP                              0.005
NUMSTEP                               200
MAXTIME                               1.5
------------------------------------------------------------------------SOLVER 1
NAME                                  Structure_Solver
SOLVER                                Superlu
