DISPLACEMENT                          yes
USE_ABSOLUTE_POSITIONS                yes
TRIAD_VISUALIZATIONPOINT              yes
STRAINS_GAUSSPOINT                    yes
ELEMENT_GID                           yes
----------------------------------------------------------------BINNING STRATEGY
BIN_SIZE_LOWER_BOUND                  10.0
DOMAINBOUNDINGBOX                     -30 -30 -30 30 30 30
